# cramgood

A hermetic transcript exercising fixtures, session state, and exit
codes — the green cram fixture.

```soil-sig
cramgood : (x : I64) -> I64
```

```cram session
with file "greeting.txt" = "hello\n"
$ cat greeting.txt
hello
$ MSG=world
$ echo "$MSG"
world
$ false
[1]
```
